    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need to look at the days on market for that \nparticular house. The house that just hit Zillow  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5920,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "day one, staged to perfection, beautiful twilight \nphotos and all of the good stuff, it is probably  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12400,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to sell on day one for the asking price or \nmore, right? The best houses always sell fast.  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19280,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is just a a law of the housing market. But \nif that house has been sitting for several weeks,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25680,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, then that kind of changes things, right? \nSo, with knowing the type of market we're in,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30960,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we should know the average days on market. And \nif this thing is over the average days on market,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36480,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that means you are probably going to be due for a \nsteep discount. Like, they're probably going to be  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40960,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dropping the price anyway. Or if we are getting \nto that 3 to 4 week, maybe 30day time span where  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48960,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "another mortgage might be due. Well, then that \nsounds like there's some negotiation room right  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54080,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there, and we might be timing it perfectly \nto shave a little bit off of the asking price  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59360,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it's got to suck as a home seller to pay \nthat mortgage when you're not living in the House."
